 scene is an immediate fall loop, perhaps from one of the kids perspectives who is forced to watch (Position up to you).\n\nこんにちは。これに似た作品を希望します: https://www.pixiv.net/ja/artworks/66029483\n\n同じキャラクターの悪魔。おそらく新しい状況ですか？適切な状況の例を示しますが、必要に応じて変更できます。主なテーマは、個人がサキュバスと戦おうとするが、うまくいかないというものです。\n\nたぶんこんな状況(あなたとの対話)\n\n最初のシーンは、2人の子供が悪魔と戦うためにダンジョンに入っていくところです。\n子供たちは悪魔に会い、それは簡単すぎると言います。\n悪魔は子供たちを見て微", "nc": 48, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 268908, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "hroz＠skeb&pixivリクエスト募集中", "screen_name": "hrozvitnir", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1146340413470461952/eT2XmnDN.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/259077107/1582940214/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 161}, {"id": 517967, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "阿山🔞", "screen_name": "chara1111", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1882201643124744192/rHCWi2WJ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/48335702/1621938599/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "video"}], "banned": false, "nc": 33}, {"id": 1346837, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "OSARUMODE（おさるも～ど） 🔞 ２Dアクション【サキュバスバトル】10月25日DL販売", "screen_name": "OSARUMODE", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1